data=successmessage,You roast the jubbly. Lovely jubbly.
data=burnmessage,You leave the jubbly on too long and it chars right through.

[cooking_generic_fishcake]
// Recipe for Disaster, Freeing Pirate Pete. Raw / cooked / burnt all shipped and nothing had ever
// made the raw one cookable - the same gap the stuffed snake and the jubbly had. No comma anywhere
